var removeOfflineSession;$(window).on("load",function(){(window.datas.sessions||{}).forEach(e=>{var n=new Date(1e3*e.epoch).toLocaleString(),t=`<a title="delete" class="removeOidcOfflineTokens" partner=${e.sessionid}>
        <span class="btn btn-danger" role="button">
          <span class="fa fa-minus-circle"></span>
          <span trspan="unregister">Unregister</span>
        </span>
      </a>`;$("tbody.oidcOfflineTokens").append($(`<tr partner="${e.sessionid}"><td>${e.id}</td><td>${n}</td><td>${t}</td></tr>`))}),$(".removeOidcOfflineTokens").on("click",function(){return removeOfflineSession($(this).attr("partner"))})}),removeOfflineSession=function(e){return delKey(e,function(){return $(`[partner='${e}']`).hide()},function(e,n,t){return alert(n+" "+t)})},delKey=function(e,n,t){return $.ajax({type:"DELETE",url:scriptname+"myoffline/"+e,dataType:"json",success:n,error:t})};